Phase 4 – Advanced Visual Analytics
Reports Page Enhancement
1. Project Overview

Previous phases delivered:

Phase 1: Data preview, transformation, dashboard builder

Phase 2: Interactive filtering & drill-down

Phase 3: Multi-dataset modeling, relationships, calculated columns, measures

Phase 4 introduces:

Advanced analytical visuals

Geospatial analysis

Forecasting & trend analytics

Statistical enhancements (clustering, regression)

Smart chart recommendations

This phase elevates the system from a BI platform to an analytical intelligence tool.

2. Scope of Phase 4

This phase includes:

Advanced Visual Types

Geospatial Visualization (Maps)

Forecasting & Trend Analysis

Statistical & Clustering Capabilities

Smart Chart Recommendation Engine

Analytical Enhancements (Trendlines, Reference Lines)

This phase does NOT include:

Natural language querying

Automated AI insight narratives

Enterprise governance

3. Functional Requirements
3.1 Advanced Visual Types
Objective

Expand visualization capabilities beyond standard charts.

Required New Visuals

System must support:

Waterfall Chart

KPI Card

Gauge Chart

Heatmap

Gantt Chart

Box Plot

Bullet Chart

Each visual must:

Integrate with filters (global, cross, chart-level)

Support measures

Support drill-down where applicable

Visual Configuration Structure
{
  "chartId": "chart_5",
  "type": "waterfall",
  "config": {
    "categoryField": "Month",
    "valueField": "Revenue",
    "showTotal": true
  }
}
Acceptance Criteria

Each visual renders correctly.

Measures work in new visuals.

Filtering updates visuals correctly.

No UI freeze with 50k rows.

Drill-down compatible where logical.

3.2 Geospatial Visualization (Maps)
Objective

Enable geographic analysis.

Functional Requirements

System must support:

Filled Map (Country/State)

Bubble Map (Latitude/Longitude)

Region Detection (auto-detect geo fields)

Geo detection logic:

Recognize fields like:

Country

State

City

Latitude

Longitude

If latitude/longitude provided:

Plot directly.

If region name provided:

Use geocoding lookup table.

Map Configuration Structure
{
  "chartId": "chart_map_1",
  "type": "map",
  "config": {
    "locationField": "Country",
    "valueField": "Revenue",
    "mapType": "filled"
  }
}
Requirements

Maps must respect filters.

Support tooltips.

Support zoom & pan.

Handle missing geo values gracefully.

Acceptance Criteria

Country-based map colors correctly.

Bubble map plots coordinates correctly.

Filters update map instantly.

No crash on invalid geo values.

3.3 Forecasting & Trend Analysis
Objective

Enable predictive and trend-based insights in time-series charts.

Functional Requirements

Applicable to line and area charts.

Add support for:

Trendline (linear regression)

Moving average (user-selectable window)

Forecast next N periods (basic regression-based)

Confidence interval shading (optional)

User controls:

Enable/disable forecasting

Set forecast horizon

Set smoothing window

Forecast Configuration
{
  "forecast": {
    "enabled": true,
    "periods": 3,
    "confidenceInterval": 0.95
  }
}
Requirements

Works only with date-based X-axis.

Must validate sufficient historical data.

Must recompute after filters applied.

Acceptance Criteria

Trendline displays correctly.

Forecast extends timeline correctly.

Forecast respects filters.

Insufficient data shows warning.

No performance degradation.

3.4 Statistical & Clustering Capabilities
Objective

Add analytical intelligence features.

Functional Requirements

Scatter plot must support:

Linear regression line

Correlation coefficient display

Clustering (K-means, configurable K)

Clustering requirements:

Default K = 3

User can change K

Cluster coloring applied automatically

Clustering Configuration
{
  "clustering": {
    "enabled": true,
    "method": "kmeans",
    "k": 3
  }
}
Rules

Clustering must operate on filtered dataset.

Clusters must update when filters change.

Must handle up to 10k points safely.

Acceptance Criteria

Regression line accurate.

Correlation displayed correctly.

Changing K updates clusters.

No UI freeze with 10k points.

3.5 Analytical Enhancements (Reference & Trend Lines)
Objective

Provide additional statistical overlays.

Required Enhancements

Charts must support:

Constant reference line

Average line

Median line

Percentile line

Conditional color thresholds

Example:

Highlight bars > average.

Add horizontal reference line at target = 100,000.

Configuration Example
{
  "referenceLines": [
    {
      "type": "average",
      "label": "Avg Revenue"
    }
  ]
}
Acceptance Criteria

Reference lines display correctly.

Conditional coloring works.

Lines respect filters.

Toggle on/off works instantly.

3.6 Smart Chart Recommendation Engine
Objective

Improve usability by suggesting optimal visual types.

Functional Requirements

When user selects fields:

System must analyze:

Data type

Cardinality

Aggregation type

Distribution

Based on rules, suggest:

Bar chart for categorical + numeric

Line chart for time-series

Histogram for continuous distribution

Scatter for numeric vs numeric

Map if geo detected

Recommendations must:

Appear before chart creation.

Allow override.

Update dynamically when fields change.

Recommendation Output Structure
{
  "recommendedCharts": [
    "line",
    "area"
  ]
}
Acceptance Criteria

Categorical + numeric → bar suggested.

Date + numeric → line suggested.

Lat/Long detected → map suggested.

User can override suggestion.

4. Performance Requirements

System must:

Maintain interaction response < 500ms.

Avoid blocking UI thread for clustering/forecast.

Offload heavy calculations to worker thread or backend.

Prevent recomputation when not needed.

Performance fails if:

UI freezes for > 1 second.

Forecasting blocks dashboard interaction.

